Small-M quantized matmul kernel provenance

The Metal kernel in small_m.py follows the structure of avlp12's qmm_mma4
(https://github.com/avlp12/mlx-lm, fast_qmm.py) as vendored by
https://github.com/ARahim3/mlx-dspark (src/mlx_dspark/small_m_qmm.py): an 8x8
simdgroup-matrix MMA tile per threadgroup with K split across eight simdgroups
and each weight group dequantized once. The multi-tile form, the dispatch, the
calibration and the integration are maintained in this repository. Both sources
are MIT licensed:

